Organization = {Shanghai Univ Elect Power; Shanghai Normal Univ},
Abstract = {The power cable is one of the most important infrastructures, which
   safety and reliability is of an important significance to the stability
   and development of urban. To the safety risk features of urban power
   cable infrastructure, this paper proposed the safety risk evaluation
   index system and quantitative identification method based on analyzing
   the composition and construction features, and established the fuzzy
   comprehensive evaluation model of underground cable infrastructure
   safety risk. A case study shows that this method is feasible, and
   consistent with the practical construction, and proposed the measures to
   prevent the occurrence of major hazards.},
