   Management},
Abstract = {In view of the problems faced by sustainable urban development and
   coordinative development of road transportation infrastructure and
   economy, the paper introduced the importance of the coordinative
   development of road transportation infrastructure and economy. The
   coordinative development of urban subsystems is the basis for
   sustainable urban development. The urban subsystems' coordinative
   development is not only an important component of sustainable urban
   development, but also promotes to build a resource-saving and
   environment-friendly society. According to synergetic principles, this
   paper analyzes the coordinative development of road transportation
   infrastructure and economy theoretically, and then establishes the
   coordinative degree model between them. At the same time, the method of
