Abstract = {This paper deals with the integration of social and economic aspects of
   sustainable urban water supply policy in the city of Thessaloniki. The
   level of public awareness concerning environmental and water related
   problems, water supply and water quality aspects, pricing policy,
   project planning, water conservation, are among the most important
   issues examined through a questionnaire conducted in 2171 respondents in
   the city of Thessaloniki. The findings and the conclusions derived from
   the survey will give the opportunity to the water utility to gather
   reliable information in order to ameliorate water services, to improve
   project planning and to implement a socially acceptable, and at the same
   time effective, water supply policy.},
