Abstract = {In order to detect the possible collision of steel structural in virtual
   pre-assembly environment, a collision detection program based on the
   bounding box algorithm and the spatial triangle intersection detection
   algorithm was developed. And the feasibility and effectiveness of the
   collision detection program in virtual pre-assembly were verified by an
   example. The results showed that: according to this method, the
   collision detection in virtual pre-assembly has good feasibility and is
   suitable to practical projects.},
