Abstract = {The undergraduate medical students use high fidelity simulation
   associated with audio-visual resources in cardiology, trauma care and
   pediatrics during clerkship using scenarios consistent with knowledge
   and skills. The captured images are analyzed by all students as well as
   the facilitator to conduct the debriefing. Through a closed
